# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CourseForge .gitignore
#
# Two rules drive everything here:
#   1. NEVER commit credentials or anything derived from student data.
#   2. NEVER commit build output. GitHub hard-rejects any file over 100 MB and
#      the installer exe is ~141 MB. Ship those as GitHub *Releases*.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- credentials -----------------------------------------------------------
canvas.token
*.token
*.bin
canvas.config.*.json
canvas.state.*.json
canvas.project.*.json
token-*.bin

# --- student / course data and audit trails --------------------------------
canvas-admin-audit.log
activity-log.jsonl
canvas-export/
grading/
private/
**/map.json
**/proposed-grades*.json
**/submissions/

# Operational working directories: real course content pulled from Canvas.
# Not source, frequently large, and not ours to publish.
courses/
audit/
pdf-lab/
pdf-text-work/
office-lab/
build/

# --- build output (the GitHub 100 MB blocker) ------------------------------
installer/dist/
installer/dist-*/
installer/build/
installer/Output/
installer/Deploy-NewMachine/*.exe
installer/dist-assistant/
installer/dist-assistant-*/
installer/build-assistant/
installer/python-embed/
installer/cache/
*.exe
*.msi

# --- python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- pdf pipeline artefacts ------------------------------------------------
# Anything the engine generates into a workdir. Never source.
# NOTE: these are deliberately NOT rooted, so they also catch workdirs nested
# under courses/ and pdf-lab/. skill/ is force-included at the bottom.
**/pdf-fastlane/
**/original.pdf
**/fixed.pdf
**/fixed.pdf.part
**/fixed.pdf.prealt
**/*.part
**/figures/
**/figures-small/
**/result.json
**/summary.json
**/queue.json
**/validation.json
**/alt-todo.json
**/alt-summary.json
**/alt.json
**/curl-fetch.cfg
startup-error.txt

# --- editor / OS -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# --- encrypted token blobs and pulled course content (added 2026-09) ---------
*.token.enc
remediation-work/
announcements/

# --- the repo IS the source: never let the patterns above swallow it -------
!skill/
!skill/**
!installer/courseforge-pdf.iss
!installer/courseforge-pdf.spec
!installer/INSTALL-GUIDE.md
!installer/cf-icon.ico
!installer/cf-icon-preview.png
!installer/courseforge-assistant.iss
!installer/courseforge-assistant.spec
!installer/Build-Assistant.ps1
!installer/INSTALL-GUIDE-ASSISTANT.md
!installer/cf-assistant-icon.ico
!installer/cf-assistant-icon-preview.png
!sync-skill.ps1
# force-include above re-admits caches; drop them again
skill/**/__pycache__/
